      "text": "Conservation report: Caddow Letters (fictional, authored test material).\nCaddow Letters had insured value of $4.8m in FY2025 (reported basis). For Caddow Letters, marginal annotations in FY2025 was 649. Illuminated initials at Caddow Letters stood at 132 in FY2025. Caddow Letters had leaf height of 344 mm in FY2023."
