      "text": "Palaeographic study: Caddow Letters (fictional, authored test material).\nCaddow Letters had insured value of $4800k in FY2025 (reported basis). For Caddow Letters, marginal annotations in FY2025 was 647. Share of palimpsest leaves at Caddow Letters stood at 33.2% in FY2024, as originally reported. Caddow Letters had binding date (CE) of 1422 in FY2024, second issue (corrects the first issue)."
    },
    {
