      "title": "Edition apparatus notes",
      "text": "Edition apparatus notes: Caddow Letters (fictional, authored test material).\nCaddow Letters had illuminated initials of 113 in FY2023. For Caddow Letters, leaf height in FY2025 was 255 mm. Share of palimpsest leaves at Caddow Letters stood at 39.3% in FY2024, as restated in the latest accounts. Caddow Letters had binding date (CE) of 1675 in FY2024, first issue."
